{"unit_id":"supart__DSH-FHL-Image-Plugin#feature-10","repo":"supart/DSH-FHL-Image-Plugin","commit":"970ffd54697c8ffee7f442629b99221eb480651e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH FHL Image 的功能「提示词生成图像」：调用 `fhl_image_generate`，输入视觉提示词、尺寸和可选张数，返回并保存 PNG 附件；每次最多生成九张。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:184-215"]}
